      "body": "This PR has been automatically converted to **draft** because all PRs must start as drafts.\n\nWhen you are ready for review, click **Ready for Review** to begin the review process. This will:\n1. Add the oncall reviewer (optional reviewer)\n2. Add required review teams based on your changes\n\nSee the [contribution guide](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/docs/developer/submit.md) for more details.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T02:33:47Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/7422#issuecomment-5707579078",
      "id": 5707579078,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-17T02:33:47Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "github-actions[bot]"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "@balasaajay @jaredcasper — could one of you take a look at this when you have a moment?\n\nThe AMP decorators in `megatron/core/tensor_parallel/layers.py` are created with `device_type=\"cuda\"`, so on any non-CUDA accelerator the autocast guard never matches the active autocast context. The patch resolves the type from `torch.accelerator.current_accelerator()`, the same way `get_compute_units()` in `batch_invariant_kernels.py` already does.\n\nHappy to adjust anything you'd like before this can move forward.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:21:56Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/7422#issuecomment-6549919495",
      "id": 6549919495,
